# Result

**TestDisk successfully analysed the virtual storage device,
identified the NTFS partition, verified the partition files,
and completed the partition recovery workflow.**

---

# Conclusion

TestDisk is a useful open-source forensic recovery utility
for analysing storage devices, identifying lost partitions,
listing files, and recovering partition information.

The experiment was safely performed on a virtual test disk
to prevent accidental modification of the actual laptop
storage.

